---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Agus Juniartha" description="Portfolio of I Wayan Agus Juniartha, Flutter mobile developer in Bali.">
<div class="pf" style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh">

<!-- Nav -->
<header style="position: sticky; top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 10; background: var(--header-bg); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<nav aria-label="Main" style="flex-wrap: wrap; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px">
<a href="#top" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Agus<span style="color: var(--accent)">.</span></a>
<div class="navlinks" id="nav-links" style="display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; font-size: 15px">
<a href="#work" class="nl" style="color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Work</a>
<a href="#experience" class="nl" style="color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Experience</a>
<a href="#skills" class="nl" style="color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Skills</a>
<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-p" style="background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 6px; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 500">Contact</a>
</div>
<button class="menu" id="menu-btn" type="button" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links" style="display: none; width: 44px; height: 44px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; color: var(--ink)">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"></path></svg>
</button>
</nav>
</header>

<main id="top">
<!-- Hero -->
<section class="sec" style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 24px 96px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center">
<div style="flex: 999 1 560px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); display: inline-block"></span>Mobile Developer · Flutter</span>
<h1 class="hero-title" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 72px; line-height: 76px; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Hi, I'm Agus. I build <span style="color: var(--accent)">Flutter apps</span> for iOS and Android.</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 600px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: var(--muted)">I'm I Wayan Agus Juniartha, a mobile developer from Bali with 4+ years building custom apps at software houses — from layout and state management to payments, push notifications and store releases.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; padding-top: 8px">
<a href="#work" class="btn btn-p" style="background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 6px; min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px">View my work
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
<a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tCClkKDkzJbYnjO0FBndTozHRXUgG7zX/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-g" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"></path></svg>Download CV</a>
<a href="https://github.com/BENTOTV" class="btn btn-g" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 19c-4 1.5-4-2-6-2.5M15 21v-3.5a3 3 0 0 0-.8-2.3c2.7-.3 5.5-1.3 5.5-6a4.6 4.6 0 0 0-1.3-3.2 4.3 4.3 0 0 0-.1-3.2s-1-.3-3.3 1.3a11.4 11.4 0 0 0-6 0C6.7 2.5 5.7 2.8 5.7 2.8a4.3 4.3 0 0 0-.1 3.2A4.6 4.6 0 0 0 4.3 9.2c0 4.6 2.8 5.6 5.5 6a3 3 0 0 0-.8 2.3V21"></path></svg>GitHub</a>
</div>
</div>
<aside aria-label="Profile" style="flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 380px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding-bottom: 12px">
<div role="img" aria-label="[Replace with your photo]" style="width: 72px; height: 72px; flex: none; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -0.01em">AJ</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0"><span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">I Wayan Agus Juniartha</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted)">Mobile Developer</span></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Now</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; text-align: right">Wine Adore</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Based in</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; text-align: right">Bali, Indonesia</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Focus</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; text-align: right">Flutter · Dart · Firebase</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0 0"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Status</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); display: inline-block"></span>Open to work</span></div>
</aside>
</section>

<!-- About / quick facts -->
<section aria-label="Quick facts" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--raised)">
<div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px; color: var(--accent)">4+ yrs</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Building with Flutter &amp; Dart</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px">105 PRs</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Merged at Wine Adore</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px">3 apps</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Shipped to the app stores</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px">GPA 3.82</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Computer Science, Udayana University</span></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Work -->
<section id="work" class="sec" style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 40px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent)">01 — Selected work</span>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px; letter-spacing: -0.01em">Apps I've helped ship</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--muted)">Production apps I've built for Wine Adore, PT. Bhawana Piranti Semesta and their clients.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">

<a href="/wine-adore/" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink)">
<div style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--inverse); color: var(--on-inverse); padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; overflow: hidden">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent)">Live · iOS + Android</span>
<svg width="64" height="48" viewBox="0 0 64 48" fill="#6aa5ff" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="40" r="2"></circle></svg>
</div>
<span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 30px; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: pre-line">Wine
marketplace</span>
</div>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px">Wine Adore</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Premium wine platform: shop, personal cellar, events, corkage venues and a store-credit wallet. 105 merged PRs, live on both stores.</p>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px">
<li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Flutter</li><li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">GetX</li><li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Stripe</li><li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Firebase</li>
</ul>
<span class="more" style="margin-top: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent)">Read the case study
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
</a>

<article class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); color: var(--ink)">
<div style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; overflow: hidden">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--raised); color: var(--accent)">Archived · Android</span>
<svg width="64" height="48" viewBox="0 0 64 48" style="fill: var(--accent)" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="40" r="2"></circle></svg>
</div>
<span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 30px; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: pre-line">Business
ERP</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px">AJB ERP</h3>
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">No longer on Google Play</span>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">ERP app built at PT. Bhawana Piranti Semesta. I worked on every feature, integrated the REST API and delivered push notifications with Pushy.me.</p>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px">
<li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Flutter</li><li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">REST API</li><li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Postman</li><li style="padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Pushy.me</li>
</ul>
</article>

<article class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); color: var(--ink)">
<div style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--sunken); color: var(--ink); padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; overflow: hidden">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--raised); color: var(--muted)">Archived · Android</span>
<svg width="64" height="48" viewBox="0 0 64 48" style="fill: var(--line-strong)" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="24" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="2"></circle><circle cx="56" cy="40" r="2"></circle></svg>
