<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Built the Cashback Promo feature: users redeem by uploading a photo from the camera or gallery, with offers filtered automatically by their location (latitude and longitude).</p>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px">
